====================================================================================================
MODEL (2)  1D DIRICHLET STRING   --  exact, Gaussian
====================================================================================================
  S_W = (1/2)phi^T A phi,  A = tridiag(2,-1) Dirichlet;  P_t = heat semigroup (var 2t).
  Hess V_t = A(I+2tA)^{-1}  >  0  for every t  =>  q(t) = ||(Hess V_t)_-||_op = 0 EXACTLY.
  Cov_t = 2t A^2 (I+2tA)^{-1}   [PSD, increasing in t]  =>  sup_t ||Cov_t||_op = lam_max(A).

      L     lam_1   lam_max  sup_t C_abs  sup_t C_int=C/L  tr/op at t=inf
