    mid    : rational shape  C(t) = c t/(1+b t) fits with b = 1/(2 lam_eff);
             C(t)/lam_max is monotone;  C(lam_max t = 1/2) / lam_max = 0.500000 ;  C(10) / lam_max = 0.952381
