====================================================================================================
MODEL (4a)  P4 PERIODIC KERNEL, one site, U(1), NON-GAUSSIAN
====================================================================================================
  e^{-S_W} = e^{beta cos theta}   (the P4 Boltzmann kernel); P_t = heat semigroup on the
  UNIT circle (-Delta eigenvalues n^2 => lam_1 = 1).  g = beta sin theta, Hess S_W = beta cos theta.
  mu_{t,th0}(d th) propto K_t(th-th0) e^{beta cos th} d th /(2 pi); exact 1D quadrature (4096 pts).

    lam1*t        C_abs          q(t)             HV  B_quad/B_char
      0.01     0.128186  2.596400e+00      -2.596400       1.00e+00
      0.03     0.406876  2.813946e+00      -2.813946       1.00e+00
       0.1     1.574173  3.661183e+00      -3.661183       1.00e+00
     0.316     3.877827  4.266422e+00      -4.266422       1.00e+00
