      3.16     1.957105  6.923392e-02      -0.069234       1.00e+00
        10     1.912537  6.932367e-05      -0.000069       1.00e+00
      31.6     1.912492  2.886580e-14      -0.000000       1.00e+00
       100     1.912492  0.000000e+00       0.000000       1.00e+00

  t -> inf check (Stein identity on the flat circle): Cov_nu = E_nu[Hess S_W]
    measured beta^2 Var_nu(sin) = 1.91249187 ;  beta E_nu[cos] = 1.91249187 ;  beta I1(beta)/I0(beta) = 1.91249187

  t->0   : C ~ A t^p,  p = 1.00156 +- 9.4e-02
  t->inf : q ~ B e^(-lam t),  lam = 1.013093 +- 2.4e-01    [lam_1 = 1]
  sup_t C_abs = 3.877827 at lam1*t = 0.316 ;  C(t=inf) = 1.912492
  => bounded, saturating:  int_0^inf C dt = infinity ;  Q(inf) ~ 4.516160

