MODEL (4b)  P4 PERIODIC KERNEL as a CIRCULANT ring  (the P4 anchor)
====================================================================================================
  A = 1D periodic Laplacian on Z_L:  lam_k = 2-2cos(2 pi k/L),  k = 0..L-1.
  lam_max = 4 EXACTLY for every even L (k = L/2).  Gaussian => q(t) = 0.

